OL,3,GNEWSACancer centre with 'world-class'
OL,4,Afacilities to reopen
OL,5,
OL,6,FA cancer centre which closed after the
OL,7,Fcompany running it went out of business
OL,8,Fis set to reopen under new owners.
OL,10,FThe Rutherford Centre initially opened
OL,11,Ffor cancer patients to great fanfare in
OL,12,F2018, offering the latest cutting edge
OL,13,Ftreatments.
OL,15,FIn 2022 the company running it closed,
OL,16,Fblaming the Covid-19 pandemic, and the
OL,17,Fbuilding has lay empty ever since.
OL,19,FIcon Group, an Australian healthcare
OL,20,Fcompany with several existing UK
OL,21,Fclinics, plans to open in the same
OL,22,Fbuilding as soon as 2027.
OL,23,APub: 24-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
